WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:08.000
Narrator: During the second half, her supervisor calls the team to egress positions, and Noura confirms on the radio.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.500
Sierra 2: Move to egress positions.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.800
Noura: Copy, moving to egress position Gate 4 exit, over.

4
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:22.500
Narrator: After the final whistle, she stays on post until her supervisor stands the team down.

5
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:32.800
Narrator: At the debrief she hands in her incident card, then returns her radio and tabard and signs out.

6
00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.300
Narrator: Ready, on post, stay, hand back.

7
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.800
Narrator: That is a match day done well.

